,"user":{"login":"polzon","id":1271677,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzE2Nzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1271677?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/polzon","html_url":"https://github.com/polzon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/polzon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/polzon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/polzon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/polzon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/polzon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/polzon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/polzon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/polzon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/polzon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-06T00:02:21Z","updated_at":"2025-03-06T00:02:21Z","body":"Unfortunately this bug made it into 4.4-stable as well.\n\nA temporary workaround I found for now is that you can set still access texture_pixel_size without issue in the fragment shader:\n\n```\nshader_type canvas_item;\n\nvarying vec2 PIXEL_SIZE;\n\nvoid light() {\n\tvec2 something = PIXEL_SIZE;\n}\n\nfragment() {\n        PIXEL_SIZE = TEXTURE_PIXEL_SIZE;\n}\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2702354424/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]